    "content": "***Before cleanup:***\nAction, 1982\u20131986 & 2008\u20132009 \u2192 **KNIGHT RIDER**\nAnimated, 2002\u20132007 \u2192 **KIM POSSIBLE**\nAnimated, 2021\u20132024 \u2192 **WHAT IF...?**\nAnthology, 2019\u20132021 \u2192 **MODERN LOVE**\nAutomotive, 1977\u20132001 & 2002\u20132022 \u2192 **TOP GEAR**\nChildren\u2019s, 1992\u20131996 \u2192 **ASTRO FARM**\nComedy, 1965\u20131970 \u2192 **GET SMART**\nComedy, 1965\u20131971 \u2192 **GREEN ACRES**\nComedy, 1984\u20131992 & 2023\u20132025 \u2192 **NIGHT COURT**\nComedy, 1995\u20131998 \u2192 **KAREN SISCO**\nComedy, 2000\u20132006 \u2192 **YES, DEAR**\nCrime drama, 2003\u20132004 \u2192 **DRAGNET**\nEspionage, 2007\u20132013 \u2192 **BURN NOTICE**\nGame show, 2005\u20132020 \u2192 **CASH CAB**\nMystery, 2019\u20132022 \u2192 **RUSSIAN DOLL**\nReality, 2010\u2013present \u2192 **SISTER WIVES**\nReality, 2024\u2013present \u2192 **BEAST GAMES**\nSoap, 1979\u20131993 \u2192 **KNOTS LANDING**\nSuperhero, 2017\u20132018 \u2192 **IRON FIST**\n\n***After cleanup:***\nAxe's handle \u2192 **HAFT**\nFailing to make a decision, or adding noise to data \u2192 **DITHERING**\nShort cannons \u2192 **HOWITZERS**\nHypothetical sequence of events or an RPG mission \u2192 **SCENARIO**\nMake embarrassed \u2192 **ABASH**\nParanoid, say \u2192 **NEUROTIC**\nAnatomical adjective that can follow \"half\" or \"broken\" \u2192 **HEARTED**\nUsing to make oneself taller, perhaps (2 wds.) \u2192 **HIGH HEELS**\nAdvance copy of a movie \u2192 **SCREENER**\nHosts' spiels when bringing out guests \u2192 **INTRODUCTIONS**\nAnything that takes up space \u2192 **MATTER**\nWeb browser or theatrical performance \u2192 **OPERA**\nIndirect literary references \u2192 **ALLUSIONS**\nLike a touchscreen that detects pressure \u2192 **RESISTIVE**\nComplete and unqualified \u2192 **ABSOLUTE**\nRemove all traces of \u2192 **ERASE**\nJimmy and Mark's ocean charity \u2192 **TEAMSEAS**\nBurnt or hackneyed \u2192 **TRITE**\nAssembles, as British soldiers